Package: gwenview
Version: @DEB_GWENVIEW_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.kde.org/gwenview/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-svg, qt6-image-formats, phonon4qt6, libexiv2-28, libjpeg62-turbo, libpng16-16, liblcms2-2, kf6-kio, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-i18n, kf6-parts, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-notifications, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-widgetsaddons
Description: Gwenview image viewer (Qt6/KF6)
 KDE image viewer with JPEG/PNG support and Exiv2-backed metadata handling.
 Optional Baloo, Purpose, RAW, FITS, TIFF, X11, and annotation integrations
 are disabled in this first Xios package.
